NAME
    gcloud artifacts projects - manage Artifact Registry project-level
        configurations for a specific location

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud artifacts projects COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Artifact Registry project-level configurations for a specific
    location.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        Describe project configuration.

     update
        Update project configuration.
